		LifeBonus: 生命上限 +{0}
		EnduranceBonus: 减伤 +{0}%
		DefenseBonus: 护甲 +{0}
		AttackBonus: 伤害 +{0}%
		LifeRegenBonus: 生命再生 +{0}
		ManaBonus: 魔力上限 +{0}
		SlotBonus: 「召唤栏」+{0}
